 impact"},{"text":"Estimate financial impact"},{"text":"Recommend improvements"},{"text":"Build implementation roadmaps"},{"text":"Present findings to management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Consulting Framework"},{"type":"flow","items":["Client Problem","Current-State Assessment","Data Collection","Energy / Carbon Analysis","Identify Opportunities","Cost-Benefit Analysis","Recommendations","Implementation Roadmap","Measurement & Reporting"]},{"type":"h","text":"Final-Year Projects"},{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Green Cloud Optimization Dashboard"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a dashboard that analyzes:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Cloud resource utilization"},{"text":"Compute consumption"},{"text":"Storage"},{"text":"Cost"},{"text":"Estimated emissions"},{"text":"Idle resources"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Technology:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Python","Cloud APIs","SQL","Power BI"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Green Data Center Analyzer"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop a system that analyzes:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Server utilization"},{"text":"Power consumption"},{"text":"Cooling requirements"},{"text":"Energy efficiency"},{"text":"PUE"},{"text":"Estimated carbon impact"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Output:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Current Infrastructure","Energy Analysis","Efficiency Score","Optimization Recommendations"]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Sustainable IT Asset Management System"},{"type":"p","text":"Track:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Laptop/server inventory"},{"text":"Purchase date"},{"text":"Age"},{"text":"Utilization"},{"text":"Maintenance"},{"text":"Repair"},{"text":"Replacement"},{"text":"Disposal"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Add sustainability scoring."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — Green Software Analyzer"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a tool that analyzes applications based on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"CPU usage"},{"text":"Memory usage"},{"text":"API calls"},{"text":"Network traffic"},{"text":"Execution time"},{"t